{"text":"Bevor du weitergehst, ein wichtiger Workbook-Stopp. Im Workbook findest du Übung 1.2: Body-Map. Auf einer Figur trägst du ein, wo du deinen Schmerz spürst. Wo ist er am stärksten? Wo strahlt er hin? Wann tritt er auf? Diese Body-Map wird uns in mehreren späteren Lektionen begleiten – und du wirst überrascht sein, wie viel klarer dein eigenes Bild wird, wenn du es einmal aufgezeichnet hast. In der nächsten Lektion – 1.3 – verlassen wir die reine Anatomie und gehen ins Verstehen einen Schritt tiefer. Wir sprechen darüber, was chronisch eigentlich bedeutet. Warum manche Schmerzen einfach nicht weggehen. Was im Nervensystem passiert, wenn Schmerz zur Dauerbegleitung wird. Und – das ist die wichtige Frage – was sich daran ändern lässt. Bis gleich.","chars":["B","e","v","o","r"," ","d","u"," ","w","e","i","t","e","r","g","e","h","s","t",","," ","e","i","n"," ","w","i","c","h","t","i","g","e","r"," ","W","o","r","k","b","o","o","k","-","S","t","o","p","p","."," ","I","m"," ","W","o","r","k","b","o","o","k"," ","f","i","n","d","e","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","Ü","b","u","n","g"," ","1",".","2",":"," ","B","o","d","y","-","M","a","p","."," ","A","u","f"," ","e","i","n","e","r"," ","F","i","g","u","r"," ","t","r","ä","g","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","e","i","n",","," ","w","o"," ","d","u"," ","d","e","i","n","e","n"," ","S","c","h","m","e","r","z"," ","s","p","ü","r","s","t","."," ","W","o"," ","i","s","t"," ","e","r"," ","a","m"," ","s","t","ä","r","k","s","t","e","n","?"," ","W","o"," ","s","t","r","a","h","l","t"," ","e","r"," ","h","i","n","?"," ","W","a","n","n"," ","t","r","i","t","t"," ","e","r"," ","a","u","f","?"," ","D","i","e","s","e"," ","B","o","d","y","-","M","a","p"," ","w","i","r","d"," ","u","n","s"," ","i","n"," ","m","e","h","r","e","r","e","n"," ","s","p","ä","t","e","r","e","n"," ","L","e","k","t","i","o","n","e","n"," ","b","e","g","l","e","i","t","e","n"," ","–"," ","u","n","d"," ","d","u"," ","w","i","r","s","t"," ","ü","b","e","r","r","a","s","c","h",